Package: dplyr
Type: Package
Title: A Grammar of Data Manipulation
Version: 1.1.4
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hadley", "Wickham", role = c("aut", "cre"),
      email = "hadley@example.test"),
    person("Romain", "Francois", role = "aut"))
Description: A fast, consistent tool for working with data frame like
    objects, both in memory and out of memory.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: cli (>= 3.4.0), generics, glue (>= 1.3.2), lifecycle (>= 1.0.3),
    magrittr (>= 1.5), methods, pillar (>= 1.9.0), R6, rlang (>= 1.1.0),
    tibble (>= 3.2.0), tidyselect (>= 1.2.0), utils, vctrs (>= 0.6.4)
Suggests: bench, broom, callr, covr, DBI, dbplyr, ggplot2, knitr,
    Lahman, lobstr, microbenchmark, nycflights13, purrr, rmarkdown,
    RMySQL, RPostgreSQL, RSQLite, stringi, testthat (>= 3.1.5), tidyr,
    withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
URL: https://dplyr.tidyverse.org, https://github.com/tidyverse/dplyr
BugReports: https://github.com/tidyverse/dplyr/issues
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: yes
RoxygenNote: 7.2.3
